0..78 Comment "// An owed code\'s decode beside a theory that includes another. A model of the"
79..155 Comment "// including theory stands at a model of the included one by its reduct, and"
156..231 Comment "// the bridge looks for that crossing only between types it can decide: the"
232..309 Comment "// decode of an owed code is compared rigidly there, never left waiting, so a"
310..386 Comment "// value at one owed code\'s decode where another\'s is wanted is still apart,"
387..463 Comment "// as in `suspended-decode.gandr`, and no reduct is run where no computation"
464..475 Comment "// may run."
